<section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <h1 class="giant" id="hero-title">
    <span class="giant-line" data-from="left"><span data-fit="0.29">Heavy</span></span>
    <span class="giant-line" data-from="right"><span data-fit="0.29">Metal</span></span>
  </h1>
  <p class="hero-lede corner-l" data-intro>Brushed titanium that pays you back: up to 8% on travel and 80,000 bonus points to start. <span class="hint-fine">Drag the card to turn it, any direction.</span><span class="hint-touch">Swipe the card to spin it, or press and hold to tip it.</span></p>
  <div class="hero-actions corner-r" data-intro>
    <a class="btn" href="#rewards">See the rewards <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    <a class="link" href="#card">Scroll the story</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stage" id="card" aria-label="The card">
  <span class="stage-mark" id="choose" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="stage-pin">
    <div class="panel" data-panel>
      <h2 class="giant panel-word" data-drift>
        <span class="giant-line"><span data-fit="0.24">18</span></span>
        <span class="giant-line"><span data-fit="0.24">Grams</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="corner-l lede" data-corner>Grade 5 titanium: about 40% lighter than steel, just as strong, and still heavy enough to make a point when it lands on the table.</p>
      <dl class="corner-r stats" data-corner>
        <div><dt>Density, g/cm³</dt><dd>4.5</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Melting point</dt><dd>1,668°</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" data-panel>
      <h2 class="giant panel-word" data-drift>
        <span class="giant-line"><span data-fit="0.24">Four</span></span>
        <span class="giant-line"><span data-fit="0.24">Layers</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="corner-l lede" data-corner>A titanium face and back, a carbon core so the contactless antenna can breathe, and a gold-plated chip set flush with the metal.</p>
      <ul class="corner-r parts" data-corner>
        <li>Titanium face</li>
        <li>Carbon core</li>
        <li>Gold-plated chip</li>
        <li>Titanium back</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" data-panel>
      <h2 class="giant panel-word" data-drift>
        <span class="giant-line"><span data-fit="0.4">Swipe</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="corner-l lede" data-corner>Quick as the messenger: tap it, dip it, or swipe it the old way. The carbon core means the metal never gets between your card and the reader.</p>
      <ul class="corner-r parts" data-corner>
        <li>Contactless</li>
        <li>Chip</li>
        <li>Stripe</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" data-panel>
      <h2 class="giant panel-word" data-drift>
        <span class="giant-line"><span data-fit="0.24">Turn it</span></span>
        <span class="giant-line"><span data-fit="0.24">over</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="corner-l lede" data-corner>The number lives on the back, laser-marked in a column, out of sight across the table. The front carries one thing: your name.</p>
      <p class="corner-r aside" data-corner>Laser-marked, never printed.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="panel panel-choose" data-panel>
      <h2 class="giant panel-word panel-word-top" data-drift>
        <span class="giant-line"><span data-fit="0.16">Make it yours</span></span>
      </h2>
      <form class="corner-l chooser" data-chooser data-corner>
        <fieldset class="finishes">
          <legend>Finish</legend>
          <label class="finish"><input type="radio" name="finish" value="black"><span class="disc" style="--disc:#232326"></span>Black</label>
          <label class="finish"><input type="radio" name="finish" value="silver"><span class="disc" style="--disc:#dcdad5"></span>Silver</label>
          <label class="finish"><input type="radio" name="finish" value="burgundy"><span class="disc" style="--disc:#7a2a3e"></span>Burgundy</label>
          <label class="finish"><input type="radio" name="finish" value="gold"><span class="disc" style="--disc:#dcb45c"></span>Gold</label>
        </fieldset>
        <div class="engrave">
          <label for="engrave">Name on the card</label>
          <input id="engrave" name="engrave" type="text" maxlength="20" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="YOUR NAME">
        </div>
      </form>
      <div class="corner-r choose-side" data-corner>
        <p class="aside" data-finish-note>Black titanium with a diamond-like carbon coat.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="#rewards">See the rewards <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
